The LLVM Project is a collection of modular and reusable compiler and
toolchain technologies.  This version adds support for CHERI on RISC-V
and MIPS64.

This port installs the LLVM core libraries (libLLVM) and tools such as
llc, opt and llvm-objdump into ${PREFIX}/llvm-cheri.  The other LLVM
sub-projects are packaged separately and build against it.
